{"hw":"ὁμόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ὁμόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ὁμόω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">unite</b>: <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ὁμωθῆναι φιλότητι,</span> = φιλότητι μιγῆναι, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.209</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> = ὁμοιόω, in <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">εἶδος ὁμώσεται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Nic.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">334</span> </span>.</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ὀμόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ὀμόω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">swear,</b> v. ὄμνυμι. </div></div>"}